  "raw_text": "hank you for clarifying that budget is the biggest driver for you right now. What \"mode\" are you in today when it comes to fast food? Are you in a budget, health, treat, convenience, explore, or stressed mode? User: Budget mode for sure. Agent: Understood, budget mode it is. When you're in budget mode, what's the first thing that changes in your fast-food order? User: Um, when I'm in budget mode, I usually don't get fast food as much or maybe I'll get something very small if I have a really bad craving and I, I want it really bad. Instead of getting a big Mac meal, I'll get like a happy meal or something small that's like half the cost. Agent: That's a practical approach to managing cravings while staying within your budget. ...",
